					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340409
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340409,
					"content": "Kami juga nemu ....",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340410
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 751340410,
					"content": "Ya, catatan aneh peninggalan seorang petualang. Mau lihat?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340411
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340411,
					"content": "Catatan petualang? Yang biasa datang ke kota terkutuk ini kebanyakan mau nyari Giok Kepulangan ... kayaknya sih enggak perlu dibaca ya.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340412
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Bona"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340412,
					"content": "Tapi dalamnya ada sebut soal Pyrophosphorite dan altar. Siapa tahu ....",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340413
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340413,
					"content": "Iya, makanya aku enggak mau baca catatannya sebelum ketemu si Giok Kepulangan-nya.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340414
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Bona"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340414,
					"content": "Lah? Kenapa?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340415
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340415,
					"content": "Selama bertahun-tahun sudah begitu banyak petualang yang mencari Tonatiuh dan Giok Kepulangan ....",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340416
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Bona"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340416,
					"content": "Tapi semua gagal, dan tidak satu pun berhasil membuktikan adanya kapal yang melayang di langit.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340417
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Bona"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340417,
					"content": "Di mata orang, itu cuma mimpi. Ilusi. Fantasi. Hiburan bagi orang-orang yang menderita karena Abyss.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340418
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Bona"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340418,
					"content": "Jadi petualangan mereka tidak pernah dicatat penutur cerita. Perbuatan mereka tidak diagungkan atau pun dikenang.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340419
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Bona"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340419,
					"content": "Kalau Tonatiuh-nya tidak ketemu, dan Giok Kepulangan-nya tidak ada, semua yang mereka sudah lakukan akan jadi sia-sia.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340420
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Bona"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340420,
					"content": "Perjalanannya yang penting.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340421
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 751340421,
					"content": "Wah? Aneh, di Natlan jarang banget loh petualang yang peduli sama prosesnya.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340422
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Bona"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340422,
					"content": "Petualang tanpa prestasi memang ada, tapi kebanyakan perlu sesuatu untuk membuktikan diri. Betul?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340423
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Bona"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340423,
					"content": "Pengalaman itu penting.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340424
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 751340424,
					"content": "Intinya, kamu berasumsi kalau kapal itu memang ada. Tapi gimana kalau ternyata bohong?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340425
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Bona"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340425,
					"content": "Makanya kita harus temuin dulu. Demi papaku, dan semua petualang yang kehilangan nyawa karena mencoba.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340426
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Bona"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340426,
					"content": "Catatan itu ... dari mana pun asalnya, isinya tidak berguna kalau kita belum menginjak geladak Tonatiuh.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340427
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Bona"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340427,
					"content": "#Jadi, {NICKNAME} dan Paimon, kalau kapalnya sudah ketemu dan kita berhasil kembali dalam keadaan utuh, kalian juga harus sebarkan ceritanya ke seantero Adventurers' Guild!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340428
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Bona"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340428,
					"content": "Tenang, si Paimon jago kok.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340429
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 751340429,
					"content": "Apa? Maksudnya Paimon lebay? Mulut Paimon ember bocor? Kalau kapal legendaris itu ketemu, enggak usah banyak lagak! Cukup kasih tahu Katheryne, sedunia otomatis tahu!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340430
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340430,
					"content": "Serahkan padaku.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340431
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 751340431,
					"content": "Lagian kita kan petualang legendaris. Kasih saja satu cerita kita ke wartawan, langsung tuh jadi berita utama!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340432
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340432,
					"content": "#Biar si {REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]} yang urus.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340433
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 751340433,
					"content": "Nguk!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340434
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340434,
					"content": "Dia setuju! Tapi bukannya dia cuma bisa ngomong sama Saurian doang ya? Memangnya ada Saurian petualang?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340435
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340435,
					"content": "Nah ... tolong kasih lihat Pyrophosphorite yang kalian temukan!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340436
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Bona"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340436,
					"content": "#Ya! {NICKNAME}, kasih lihat Pyrophosphorite-nya! Mungkin Coco bakal ingat sesuatu kalau lihat.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340437
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340437,
					"content": "Kulu ....",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340438
					],
					"speakerTitle": "\"Cocouik\""
				},
				{
					"id": 751340438,
					"content": "Fuwaaa ... nguk.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340439
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340439,
					"content": "A-Ada apa nih? SILAU! MATA PAIMON!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340440
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340440,
					"content": "Chii! Kuchii!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340441
					],
					"speakerTitle": "\"Cocouik\""
				},
				{
					"id": 751340441,
					"content": "Coco tiba-tiba ... segar!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340442
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340442,
					"content": "Kayak mau nembakin Laser Super Gacor.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340443
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 751340443,
					"content": "#{NICKNAME} ... NAMA KAYAK GITU KOK MANTAP BANGET INGETNYA!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340444
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340444,
					"content": "Uh, apa jangan-jangan ini fenomena yang sama kayak remahan energi yang kita lihat tempo hari ...? Pyrophosphorite bisa nyimpan energi?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340445
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340445,
					"content": "Pyrophosphorite juga mengandung energi ya.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340446
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 751340446,
					"content": "Apa jangan-jangan ini fenomena yang sama kayak remahan energi yang kita lihat tempo hari ...? Pyrophosphorite bisa nyimpan energi?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340447
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340447,
					"content": "Dan Coco pake energinya buat ngelawan Abyss.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340448
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340448,
					"content": "Nguk! NGUK!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340449
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340449,
					"content": "#{NICKNAME}, lihat!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340450
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Bona"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340450,
					"content": "Wah, apa yang terjadi? Muralnya berubah!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340451
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340451,
					"content": "Jadi lukisan yang tadi itu menutupi ini.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340452
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Bona"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340452,
					"content": "Aku pernah lihat adegan ini di mural lain.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340453
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 751340453,
					"content": "Naga segede gaban itu ada di mural yang di reruntuhan tempat kita dapat Cakram Emas Ultimatum pertama, ya kan?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340454
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340454,
					"content": "Tapi di sini, si naga hitam itu kelihatan kayak bosnya.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340455
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340455,
					"content": "Naganya sudah mengakar di kota.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340456
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 751340456,
					"content": "Di dini kayak dia yang jadi bosnya.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340457
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340457,
					"content": "Ciii ... Ku!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340458
					],
					"speakerTitle": "\"Cocouik\""
				},
				{
					"id": 751340458,
					"content": "Coco? Kenapa? Tahu sesuatu tentang mural?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340459
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340459,
					"content": "Yiii!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340460
					],
					"speakerTitle": "\"Cocouik\""
				},
				{
					"id": 751340460,
					"content": "Sinarnya nunjuk ke langit ....",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340461
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340461,
					"content": "Gluk, gluk!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340462
					],
					"speakerTitle": "\"Cocouik\""
				},
				{
					"id": 751340462,
					"content": "Ini dia ... Altar Api Purba pasti di arah sana! Di titik tertinggi kota kuno!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340463
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Bona"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340463,
					"content": "Yakin? Paimon jadi suka khawatir kalau kamu tiba-tiba yakin gitu.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340464
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340464,
					"content": "Percayalah, sekali lagi saja! Firasatku pasti tepat kali ini!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340465
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Bona"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340465,
					"content": "Firasat ya? Ya sudah, toh kita juga cuma modal itu sekarang. Kita naik.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				}
			]
		}
	]
}